<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ sharemarket closed Wednesday, Thursday.</title>
<headline>NZ sharemarket closed Wednesday, Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand sharemarket was closed for New Year holidays on Wednesday and Thursday and reopens for a full day's trading on Friday.</p>
<p>The market ended 1996 up 3.21 points at 2,359.64 on the NZSE40 capital index on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473 4746</p>
